Flight Tracker and Plane Radaris a real-time flight tracking app around the world. With the help of the application, everyone can turn their device into a handy aircraft tracker and radar for those who like to travel or are interested in what kind of plane flew overhead and where it is going. Get detailed information about the flight and aircraft for each flight, as well as track weather conditions in the areas of your route on an interesting animated map. All available airlines are collected here, you can view complete information about all airports in the world, statistics of delays and flight cancellations for the selected period.



The application is also indispensable for those who often travel on business trips, the tracker shows the time of arrival or delays to the nearest minute, which will allow you to clearly plan everything, and in case of a flight cancellation, find an alternative one in one click. With widgets, you will never miss urgent information about your flight or schedule changes. You can also view information about the transfer from the airport to your destination, thereby saving time searching for transport.



The detailed view of your flights includes information about all your past, current and future trips, with the ability to delete or archive, as well as search by date.



When your loved ones are in flight, you can easily watch them. What's more, you don't have to go to the airport in advance to meet them!

Features:

Sleek, attractive and easy to read user interface.

Quick access to worldwide flight status by flight number, airport, airline or route;

Aircraft identification, visualization of flight information including aircraft image;

Airport information: arrival and departure board, flight status, delay statistics and weather conditions;

Unlimited customizable notifications so you never miss a flight;

Easily switch between basic, detailed, hybrid and satellite maps
